Also...

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:47.370
This fragrance that makes it
smell as if it’s freshly baked...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.260
There’s no mistake.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:51.640
Bamboo charcoal has been used in this bread.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.020
That’s right.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:58.840
Bamboo charcoal has been mixed
into this Improved <i>Japan</i> #56.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.450
From time immemorial,

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.690
bamboo charcoal has been used as a medicinal remedy by common folk,

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.850
and as a substance to aid growth.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.570
Recent scientific studies have determined that

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:13.030
the dioxins and active oxygen
that are left behind in the body...

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:17.750
along with food additives, harmful
bacteria and various toxic substances...

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.460
