inactivated by its special properties.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.370
It’s good for your health,
and also helps in dieting.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.380
It really is the ideal ingredient.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.760
