the charcoal also becomes very fine.

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:18.440
These minuscule particles
become one with the bread dough.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.510
You can’t copy this off of us,
even if you did headstands.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.070
